# Clerk keyless dev credentials. In the ROOT gitignore on purpose: this same rule
# lived in web/.gitignore for a while, which meant it only applied on branches that
# had that file — so the secret was stageable on every other branch. An ignore rule
# guarding a secret has to be branch-independent.
.clerk/

